+"""SCons.Tool.sgilink
+
+Tool-specific initialization for the SGI MIPSPro linker on SGI.
+
+There normally shouldn't be any need to import this module directly.
+It will usually be imported through the generic SCons.Tool.Tool()
+selection method.
+
+"""
+
+#
